Question 1
How does occupancy change in response to fire across forest types?

```{r}

q1 <- auto_occ(
  ~Forest * Year
  ~ Forest * Fire,
  y = deer_y,
  det_covs = Year_frame,
  occ_covs = Year_frame
)


summary(q1)



